# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw downloaded market data is NOT committed: size + Yahoo Finance data-use
# terms. Recreate it with:
#   python scripts/fetch_market_data.py --tickers ... --factors ... \
#       --start ... --end ... --outdir data/market
# The derived input pack (examples/real/) IS committed, so optimization and
# verification work offline.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/market/

# Regenerable bulk artifacts (daily wealth paths, per-rebalance trade logs).
# Rerun the scripts to recreate them.
outputs/**/equity_curves.csv
outputs/**/turnover_*.csv

# Selected results referenced in report.md ARE committed on purpose:
#   outputs/run1/            synthetic optimization + compliance report
#   outputs/run_real/        real-data optimization + compliance report
#   outputs/verification/    evaluation record + baseline comparison
#   outputs/backtest/        synthetic walk-forward summary + sub-periods
#   outputs/backtest_market/ real walk-forward summary, sub-periods, chart,
#                            and the QP weights history cited in report §7.1
